@startuml
title Activity 09 - Executive Creates and Submits Purchase Order

|System|
start
:Receive approved purchase request;
:Copy approved items into PO draft;
:Assign PO localId and draft status;
:Place draft in Executive queue;
|Department Executive|
:Open PO Review;
:Check supplier, payment terms and delivery date;
:Check item quantities and prices;
:Edit permitted PO fields;
|Frontend|
:Validate PO before submission;
if (PO valid?) then (yes)
  :POST PO submission;
  |Backend|
  :Verify request is APPROVED;
  :Persist PO with status = PENDING_MANAGER;
  :Create manager approval notification;
  :Send manager email;
  |Department Executive|
  :See submitted confirmation;
  stop
else (no)
  :Show invalid supplier, terms or item errors;
  stop
endif
@enduml
